# CT07 keypad (mtk-kpd). Scancodes as reported by the driver and the DTS key
# matrix; 116 is the PMIC power pin, wired to the red key.
#
# The red key is the only system key (there is no power button), so it is
# ENDCALL with WAKE: hang up, go home and sleep (END_BUTTON_BEHAVIOR 3, set
# by MonoLaunch), power menu on a long press, and it wakes the screen. The
# soft keys wake the screen too; the digits do not.

# Keypad
key 2     1
key 3     2
key 4     3
key 5     4
key 6     5
key 7     6
key 8     7
key 9     8
key 10    9
key 11    0
key 227   STAR
key 523   POUND

# Soft keys (left = MENU, right = BACK)
key 56    MENU
key 100   BACK

# D-pad
key 103   DPAD_UP
key 108   DPAD_DOWN
key 105   DPAD_LEFT
key 106   DPAD_RIGHT
key 352   DPAD_CENTER

# Green / red
key 231   CALL
key 116   ENDCALL   WAKE

# Side keys as wired in the matrix (not all of them are fitted).
key 212   CAMERA
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN

# From the stock table (not on the matrix).
key 113   MUTE
key 211   FOCUS
